  "stem": "A body of mass 1 kg begins to move under the action of a time dependent force $\\overrightarrow{F} = (2t\\widehat{i} + 3t^{2}\\widehat{j})$N, where $\\widehat{i}\\ and\\ \\widehat{j}$ are unit vectors along x and y axis. What power will be developed by the force at the time t?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$(2t^{2} + 3t^{3})$W",
    "B": "$(2t^{2} + 4t^{4})$W",
    "C": "$(2t^{3} + 4t^{4})$W",
    "D": "$(2t^{3} + 3t^{5})$W"
  },
  "answer": {
